          "locales": {
            "en": {
              "text": "<p>I'm a <b>Cloud & DevOps Engineer</b> with <b>2+ years</b> of hands-on experience shipping reliable cloud infrastructure and automated releases.</p><p>I build <b>CI/CD pipelines</b>, run <b>Docker + Kubernetes</b> workloads on <b>AWS</b>, and provision infrastructure with <b>Terraform</b>, with monitoring built in from day one.</p><p>Beyond the cloud, I follow <b>finance & markets</b> closely and enjoy bringing data and automation to financial problems.</p><p><b>My focus:</b> faster, safer releases, higher uptime, and infrastructure that scales with the business.</p>"
            }
